et  preparing it for something if you think  you know what they might be doing at  Riverrun leave it down in the comments  because I would like to hear what ideas  you may have about this news but to sum  everything up in this video season 8  preparations have already begun and they  are setting the stage to start filming  in October more news and photos will  start to come out daily very soon now  that things are underway and we might  have a long wait but I am already  getting excited just thinking about some  of the things that we could potentially  see in the final season since the final  six episodes maybe around feature film  length I think we can expect it to be  visually stunning once again I just hope  they crafted the scripts well enough to  tell a cohesive story that makes sense  and is satisfying in some way although  we will probably get a better sweet  ending in the television show too but  either way I will be happy because there  aren't any other shows that I am  dedicated to like I am with Game of  Thrones I hope to see you all continue  this journey with me  so thank you all so much for watching  today's video things are just getting  started with production so make sure you  are subscribed to the channel that way  you can stay up to date with any and  everything Game of Thrones related I  also want to thank you kind people on  patreon who support this channel I  really do appreciate all that you do I  hope everyone has a great day bye  [Music]

